<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.67 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.85 vs   2.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.80 vs   2.13</p>
<p> Sales		   16.60 vs  16.99</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    18.68 vs  15.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	30.85 vs  23.49</p>
<p> Operating profit    29.54 vs  22.96</p>
<p> Sales		  169.43 vs 139.15</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Wrocoaw</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
